WEBVTT

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Haruka na omoi seijaku no oka de
The distant feelings are on the hill of silence

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Subete no ai wo
With all the love...

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:32.500
Get ready!

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Zankoku na sekai ni furuenaide
Don't shiver in this cruel world

00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:04.000
Ikusen no kotoba yori mo uta no kisu wo
Better than a thousand words is the kiss of song

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Nanika wo sutesatte mo ii (Swear to you)
It's okay to abandon something (Swear to you)

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:14.000
Kono shunkan ni ikiru (Hold my hand)
To live in this momment (Hold my hand)

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:19.000
Kimi no tame ni, boku no tame ni
For you, for myself

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:23.000
Tobitatsu kakugo wo ima
We have to be ready to take flight

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:24.500
Tomo ni, saa, ikou ka
Now, let's go together

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:29.000
Itoshii kimi no voice　tsuyoi shoudou ni nari
Your sweet voice becomes my strong impulse

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:34.000
Yume no shissou aru ga mama ni
To keep following my dreams

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:40.000
Shinkuro shiteku kodou aa, kiseki wo koe
Our synchronized heartbeats exceed any miracle

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:41.500
(Feel your song) Chijou no hoshi
(Feel your song) It's like a star on earth

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.000
(Feel my song) Kanata no yume
(Feel my song) The faraway dream

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:49.000
Mada minu mirai ni todoku made
And until we reach a yet unseen future

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:53.000
Uta wo kanadeyou
Let's keep playing this song

00:01:54.500 --> 00:02:02.000
Tsunagaru omoi  kagayaki no oka de
Our feelings will connect on the radiant hill

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:04.000
--Song: Canon (Miyano Mamoru/Ichinose Tokiya)--

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:08.000
Thank you for the good work, everyone!

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:15.000
Okay! It's time for the party!

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:21.000
It's so unexpected that all of us have a day off at the same time.

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:23.000
A real golden opportunity.

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:26.000
It's really Christmas.

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:28.000
It's the wish of the goddesses and muses.

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:31.000
Let's make it a wonderful party!

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:33.000
Yeah!

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:40.000
Good work today, everyone!

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:42.000
Oh, Rei-chan!

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:44.000
Good work today!

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:45.000
You too!

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:46.000
Good work.

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:49.000
You still have work, don't you, Senpai?

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:51.000
We'll be done by the evening.

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:55.000
I'm looking forward to tonight's party!

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:59.000
Are you going to come at the scheduled time?

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:02.000
Of course! Right?

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:04.000
Huh?

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:08.000
It seems Saotome will also be there, so it can't be helped.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:13.000
Do you guys know that...Christmas means eating meat!

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:16.000
I got that, Ran-chan!

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:19.000
We have prepared the highest grade Japanese beef.

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:21.500
Highest grade, you said?

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:26.000
Ran-Ran! We'll also have the Kotobuki boxed lunch's fried food!

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:30.000
That's...delicious.

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:32.000
Fried food...

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:35.000
That's true! Rei-chan's home's fried food is really tasty!

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:40.500
I hope you also have sweets.

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:50.500
Yes. Aside from the normally sweet cakes, we'll prepare
some extra sweet for you, Camus-senpai.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.000
We'll also have finest quality strawberries.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:57.000
Vey well. If you say so much, I could go to your party.

00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:01.000
Oh! I'm so excited for the party!

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:09.000
Oh, welcome back, evryone!
You worked hard today!

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:13.000
I'm back.

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:16.000
Where should we put these, little lamb?

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:20.000
The presents for the gift exchange, right? Um...

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:25.000
Leave them on the table over there for now, please.

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:26.000
Okay.

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:34.000
I prepared some decorations.
The ingredients are in the fridge...

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:37.000
The cake we reserved has also arrived.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:41.000
Thanks for taking care of everything, Haruka.

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:43.000
We will finish up the rest.

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:46.000
Don't worry and go to work!

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:51.000
Yes, thank you very much!
Then, I will leave the rest to you!

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:13.000
We do not have time to waste.

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:19.000
We cannot let a party where we invited everyone
from the Shining Agency become a failure.

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:21.000
Flawless Tokiya's here!

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:26.000
Ren and Hijirikawa-san will take care
of the cooking, as we planned.

00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:28.000
I got it.

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:30.000
I won't betray your expectations!

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:35.000
Shinomiya-san, please help with
the cooking and decorating.

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:37.000
Yes!

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:41.500
Shou and Aijima-san, Please take care of the tree first.

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:43.500
Okay, leave it to us!

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.500
Understood.

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:48.000
Hey, Tokiya! What should I do?

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:54.500
You and I will put numbers on the presents, will
make the lottery and prepare the games.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:56.000
Okay!

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:58.500
Please start working, everyone!

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:00.000
OK!

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:04.900
Okay! I'll make it a fancy tree!

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:06.000
Fancy?

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:13.000
Yeah! I won't decorate it randomly,
but choose the design first.

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:17.000
then we should start.

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:18.000
Yeah.

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:23.000
I'll go with Japanese cuisine using Kyoto winter ingredients.

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:27.500
I'll go with passionate Italian cooking
that lights a flame in the cold season.

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:31.000
Wow! You both are cool!

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:40.000
This takes me back to my childhood days!

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:47.000
Together with the teacher and everyone, we'd
prepare for the Christmas party.

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:49.000
It was so much fun!

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:53.000
You have some nice memories.

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:55.000
Hey, what about you, Tokiya?

00:06:55.500 --> 00:07:01.000
My family didn't celebrate events
very often, but during Christmas

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:08.000
I was happy looking at the town overflowing in light.

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:11.000
I see...How about everyone?

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:16.000
Me and my younger brother Kaoru were
always looking forward to eating cake.

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:21.500
We'd  argue who eats the middle decoration
so much it'd become a real contest.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:26.000
On the following year, we had a cake with two decorations.

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:29.000
You have a twin younger brother, right?

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:32.500
You're twins? I want to meet him!

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:35.500
I'll call him over next time.
Kaoru also wants to meet everyone.

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:43.000
Wah! A small and cute Syo-chan and
a small and cute Kaoru-kun! I can't wait!

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:47.000
What about your Christmas memories?

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:54.000
I grew up surrounded by animals in a farm in Hokkaido,
so I also wanted to become friends with the reindeers.

00:07:54.500 --> 00:08:02.000
I tried my best to stay awake until Santa arrived,
but I always ended up falling asleep.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:07.000
Santa has a difficult job, staying
up until late every year.

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:08.000
Oh...yeah...

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:12.000
What was your Christmas like, Cessie?

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:17.000
Agnapolis is a muses' country, so we don't celebrate Christmas.

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:28.000
But because my mother is Japanese, I had Christmas
picture books and I always read them with excitement.

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:34.000
I was very happy the first time I
experienced Christmas in Japan.

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:35.500
I'm glad.

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:38.000
What about you, Masato, Ren?

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:43.000
Hijirikawa and I were taken to the
adult's parties most of the time.

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:47.000
I remember we were once invited to a party on a ship.

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:49.500
Hah, right.

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:56.000
We were bored so we sneaked out together
and explored the whole ship.

00:08:56.500 --> 00:09:02.000
Right! And after that we gazed at the starry sky
from the ship's deck, and we were the only ones there.

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:03.000
Yeah.

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:06.000
It's so mysterious...

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:11.500
Even though the seven of us have spent
different Christmases in different places

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:18.000
That is true...Now we are going to
celebrate Christmas Eve together.

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:21.000
That's so nice...It's the best!

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:21.000
Hey, Ryuuya! Which one do you think is best?

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:23.000
I don't care.

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:31.000
All of them fit me so care it's scary!
No way, this one's also so cute!

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:39.000
That's right! Tonight I'll be going to a party
with everyone in my agency! I can't wait!

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:46.000
--first sunrise of the new year---

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:52.000
Hey, everyone! Did you think about what I told you?

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:54.000
About what?

00:10:54.500 --> 00:11:01.000
Huh? I said we should also make new songs
and sing together more, didn't I?

00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:02.000
Oh...

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:08.000
Didn't watching younger ones do their best fire
you up so much you can't sit around anymore?

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:09.500
I refuse.

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:15.000
No way! but Ran-Ran, at the UtaPuri Award...

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:18.000
I told you that I can't accept anything half done.

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:23.000
I refuse to go along with it as long as
you can't make a song I can approve.

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:28.000
Does that mean that if you like the song
it's okay to sing more together?

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:54.000
Shut up, you're so ignorant.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:33.000
If we don't accept, Reiji will probably
keep bugging us about it.

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:36.000
Ai-Ai! Hey, what do you say, Miu-chan?

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:42.000
Yay! If you don't deny it, it means it's okay, right?

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:43.000
That's not true.

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:50.000
I'm glad! i'm so glad! Ran-Ran, Ai-Ai, Miu-chan!

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:52.000
How foolish.

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:58.000
Uh! But I'm happy!

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:04.000
it's snowing!

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:06.000
So we'll have a White Chrismas, huh?

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:07.500
That's so nice...

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:09.500
I'm sure it will pile up.

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:13.000
It's so beautiful, like the wings of an angel.

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:28.000
Nanami-san! The client will arrive late because of the snow.

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:33.000
You'll be able to leave quite late. Is that okay?
You said you had something so to, didn't you?

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:36.000
Oh...No, it's okay.

00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:42.000
That really helps! Then, I'm sorry, but can
you waste some time until they arrive?

00:12:42.500 --> 00:12:43.500
Yes.

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:54.000
From: Ittoki Otoya.
Subject: It's a white Christmas
Message: We're perry much done here.
Do you think you can make it?

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:57.000
Yes, this is Ittoki!

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:06.000
The meeting with the client hasn't started yet...
I'm sorry, I won't make it to the party.

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:08.500
Do you want us to start the party later?

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:14.000
No, when I am done here, I will come back in a hurry.
That's why, please start the party at the scheduled time.

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:19.000
The president and teachers are coming
even though they are so busy.

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:21.000
Okay, got it.

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:29.000
It's just like Nanami-san to be considerate.

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:33.000
Yeah, she also does her best in her work.

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:39.000
Her effort supports us STARISH. And...

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:44.000
It's not just Nanami.
We're getting support from a lot of people.

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:52.000
Yes! After debuting as an idol and taking part
in live concerts, I also understood that well!

00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:56.000
Our teachers, our Senpai, the staff...

00:13:56.500 --> 00:14:02.000
And the ladies and gentelmen who always cheer for us.

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:07.000
Right! They say they get strength from us, but

00:14:07.500 --> 00:14:12.000
It's us who receive more energy from everyone.

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:16.500
Yeah! I get encouraged by their cheers and their letters!

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:22.000
Let's sing with all our hearts for them from now on,
even more than before!

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:26.000
What? What are all of you talking about?

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:30.000
We were talking about doing our best from now on as well.

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:34.000
Huh? That's so nice! But we won't lose to you!

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:37.000
Hey, hey! I have an idea!

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:17.000
Merry Christams, everyone! This wonderful year
is the best present I could get!

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:28.000
--Song: Shining Star Xmas (STARISH & QUARTET NIGHT)--

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:52.000
Juunigatsu no sora ni yuki ga matte
As snow dances on the December sky

00:15:52.500 --> 00:15:58.000
Futo ima omoidasu
I am suddenly reminded

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:06.000
Tsunagiatta ano hibi jueru ni kawatta
Of our days together turned into jewels

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:15.000
Melody ga harmony ga kirameite
Our melody is glittering in harmony

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:23.000
Hajimari no tomoshibi wa atatakaku tsumuide
The torch of beginning is spinning warmly

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:30.000
Takusan no kyandoru ni ai wo yadoshiteku
Entrusting love to the numerous candles

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:36.000
Hokori kagayaki uta ni kawatteyuku yo
Radiating proudly, it turns into song

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:40.000
All love

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:47.000
Merry Christmas

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:52.000
Issho ni utaou Christmas
Let's sing together this Christmas

00:16:52.500 --> 00:16:58.000
Taisetsuna deaeta kiseki wo
About our precious, miraculous meeting

00:16:58.500 --> 00:17:02.000
Merry Christmas

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:07.000
Minna wo happy ni Christmas
Let's all celebrate Christmas together happily

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:13.000
Hibiku tsutau seiya ni saa
On this holy night, let's resound a song

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:18.000
Koe wo kasanete
Combining our voices

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:36.500
Everyone...

00:17:37.500 --> 00:17:40.000
Merry Christmas!

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:43.500
Merry...

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:47.000
Merry Christmas!

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:52.800
Haruka!

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:54.200
Tomo-chan!

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:57.500
Haruka, I've been waiting for you!
Welcome back!

00:17:58.000 --> 00:17:59.500
Thanks, Tomo-chan!

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:02.500
Oh! Merry Christmas, haruka!

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:05.000
Merry Christmas, Tomo-chan!

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:13.000
Hahaha! Merry Christmas!!

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:17.000
It's night, but mornin'!

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:19.000
Let's start the party!

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:29.000
--Song:Yume Oibito e no Symphony (STARISH)--

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:36.000
Sono te wo mune ni sukoshi atete mite hoshii
Put your hand on your chest for a bit

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:41.000
Kanjiru darou? attakai oto
You will surely feel a warm sound

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:47.000
Yasashii sono ne wa kimi ni shika nai melody wo
That gentle sound is your own melody

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:52.000
Sasaeru rizumu, shinjite kudasai
Please believe in the rhythm supporting you

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:57.500
Yorokobi mo, yuuki mo kono saki ni aru asu wo
Happines, courage, the tomorrow that's to come

00:18:58.000 --> 00:19:03.000
Tsumugu ongaku mo, namida sae mo
The music that follows, even your tears

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:09.000
Subete no hanbun wo seowasete hoshii
Let us share half of everything

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:13.000
Zutto tonari ni iru yo
We'll always be by your side

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:16.000
We love your song, we need you

00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:19.000
Kimi wa kimi da yo
You are yourself

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:24.000
Aru ga mama ni yume egaite
Follow your dreams in your own way

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:27.000
We love your song, we feel you

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:30.000
Tomo ni yukou star road
Let's go on the star road together

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:38.500
Soshite kono symphony anata ni sasagu
And we will offer this symphony to you

00:19:40.500 --> 00:19:46.500
Tatoe donna kabe ga attatte sa
No matter what walls you encounter

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:51.000
Egao dake wa wasurezu ni
Just don't forget to smile

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:57.500
Ai to hoshi to nanairo no na no moto
In the name of love, stars and the rainbow colours

00:19:58.500 --> 00:20:01.500
Yume ou anata e
Let the song shine

00:20:02.000 --> 00:20:05.700
Uta yo kagayake
To you, who are chasing your dreams

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:25.000
I'm happy we could all have a party together!

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:29.000
Yes! Thank you very much, everyone!

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:33.000
There's only a bit left from this eventful year.

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:35.000
It was the best year!

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:38.000
I hope we can make next next year to be even better!

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:43.000
We can! We're just starting, aren't we?

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:48.000
You're right. With little lamb's songs
and if the seven of us are together...

00:20:48.500 --> 00:20:53.000
We can go anywhere and everywhere, higher and quicker.

00:20:53.500 --> 00:20:58.000
Let's go! Together!

00:20:59.500 --> 00:21:02.000
--Translation by shyuu@miraclesmay.wordpress.com--
